  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Unlimited qi sea grows stronger by gathering many kinds of qi. After Qi Xiang created the move, he collected all sorts of qi into the immortal aperture, including blade qi among life qi, death qi, sword qi, dusk qi, dawn qi, and others. Unused stored qi dissipates over time. Dusk qi and dawn qi from that stock are covered on dusk qi and dawn qi.",
